data: {"id": "84d3923c73a74521-thinking-parallel_evidence-811", "run_id": "84d3923c73a74521", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "No node in the cluster has the label `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`. This confirms the node affinity mismatch is the direct cause.\n\nNow let me compile the evidence conclusion.\n\n---\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 实体身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` (UID: `840e1f30-952d-4886-9edd-e96097582f87`)\n- **控制器链**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-68c557d875` → Pod\n- **状态**: `Pending`，`node: <none>`，`PodScheduled: False`，从未获得 IP（因此 Metrics/Logs/Tracing 均为空是预期行为）\n\n### 已确认事实（支持 PendingUnsche", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789039798102, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

