/3) → 触发 FailedScheduling Event → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** Pod `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` 的 `nodeSelector` 或节点亲和性配置了标签 `aiops.lab/unavailable: true`，但集群中没有任何节点拥有此标签，导致调度器无法找到匹配节点。\n\n- **证据支持：** \n  - `fact-3e5a7ac9b25a` (Event) 和 `fact-4a1da4fa6d6d` (Condition) 明确记录调度失败原因为“节点未匹配 Pod 的亲和性/选择器”。\n  - 诊断信息中明确指出配置了 `nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable: true`，且集群无此标签节点。\n  - `fact-f02a83eb46c2` (Metric) 确认 Pod 当前状态为 `Pending`，符合调度失败的预期结果。\n  - 资源类事实排除资源不足因素。\n- **结论：** 现有证据充分，根因为配置不匹配导致的调度失败，无证据不足情况。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 33.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8: 33.6s (Evidence 27.2s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 66.949, "metrics": {"run_id": "84d3923c73a74521", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 66.95460939407349, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"na